<% page_title "Omarchy hardware" %>

<section class="max-w-2xl">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Does this machine run Omarchy?</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 text-muted">People already on Omarchy submit hardware facts, then claim that report with an account. Lookup counts those claimed reports, not anonymous posts. After a claim you can list from the report.</p>
</section>

<%= render "hardware_models/lookup_form", query: @query, submit_label: "Look up" %>

<section class="mt-12 max-w-2xl">
  <h2 class="text-lg font-medium">How to use this site</h2>
  <ol class="mt-4 list-decimal space-y-4 pl-5 text-muted">
    <li>
      <p>Look up a vendor or model in the field above. Suggestions appear as you type. Open a result to see who has claimed that hardware after running Omarchy.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>If you already run Omarchy, submit a hardware report from that machine:</p>
      <pre class="mt-2 overflow-x-auto rounded-md bg-panel p-4 text-sm text-paper"><code><%= collect_command %></code></pre>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm">The script prints a claim link. An unclaimed report stays off the public lookup.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p><%= link_to "Sign in", new_session_path %> (or <%= link_to "create an account", new_registration_path %>) and open the claim link. That attaches the report to you.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>From <%= link_to "My reports", me_reports_path %>, list a claimed report for sale or donation. Market does not take payment or ship anything. Buyers contact the owner by email.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<% if @models.any? %>
  <section class="mt-12">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-medium">Claimed models</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 divide-y divide-white/10 border-y border-white/10">
      <% @models.each do |model| %>
        <li class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 py-3">
          <%= link_to "#{model.vendor} #{model.product}", hardware_model_path(model.model_slug), class: "text-paper no-underline hover:text-accent" %>
          <span class="text-sm text-muted"><%= pluralize(model.claimants_count, "person") %> · <%= evidence_label(model.claimants_count) %></span>
        </li>
      <% end %>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-4"><%= link_to "All models", hardware_models_path %></p>
  </section>
<% end %>

<% if @listings.any? %>
  <section class="mt-12">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-medium">Latest listings</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <% @listings.each do |listing| %>
        <%= render "listings/card", listing: listing %>
      <% end %>
    </ul>
  </section>
<% end %>
